# Image contains code and the verified business release bundle. Runtime data, other snapshots, tests and secrets stay outside.
*
!src
!src/data_collection
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
src/data_collection/data
src/data_collection/cache
src/data_collection/tests
src/data_collection/sample
src/data_collection/snapshots/*
!src/data_collection/snapshots/2026-09-30-business
!src/data_collection/snapshots/2026-09-30-business/**
# Mapping combo đã duyệt tay: job nạp DB ghép vào kết quả parse_combos (fresh_catalog_db.load_into_db).
!src/data_collection/snapshots/2026-09-30/combo_items_manual.jsonl

# The index job imports backend code. Re-exclude caches, virtualenvs and secrets after the re-include.
!src/backend/
!src/backend/**
src/backend/tests/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
